{"title":"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/5/6656c09a9bebda29c86971a536febad467d16343.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\log_8 225$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/4/414099b688a8f929600940e3fb9398a4e5ef1a83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=\\log_2 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"17\" />, then\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/4/24405f7934eeea8afdc1f39865d7966b281efcc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } a=b/2\\quad \\text{(B) } a=2b/3\\quad \\text{(C) } a=b\\quad \\text{(D) } b=a/2\\quad \\text{(E) } a=3b/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"517\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The solutions imply that finding the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/4/084079bf1d54500f3c59257a7ec3467932b72ba2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"34\" /> will solve the problem.  We compute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/4/084079bf1d54500f3c59257a7ec3467932b72ba2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"34\" />, use change-of-base to a neutral base, rearrange the terms, and then use the reverse-change-of-base:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/b/f5bd76044f6913d46bd915548a8eabd927514525.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log_8 225}{\\log_2 15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"63\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/1/9d1b78540debf80137910e06cf1be0782e4940f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{\\ln 225}{\\ln 8}}{\\frac{\\ln 15}{\\ln 2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"39\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/b/19b86d246434ebbf56e50affd5302f1b275ab78a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\ln 225 \\ln 2}{\\ln 15 \\ln 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/3/7334c7b3b59bdfa12d78be35c8306b1d14d8ca2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\ln 225}{\\ln 15} \\cdot \\frac{\\ln 2}{\\ln 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/0/0805c3d3b9b151eb36761efdf96fd8ee9420c008.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ln_{15} 225 \\cdot \\ln_8 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/8/a5862a79756d47017889ee5f1506601128979a53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15^2 = 225$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"17\" />, the first logarithm is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/4/164bd3e6ac9b09e1fda1b793523d88c92789012c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^{\\frac{1}{3}} = 2$\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" />, the second logarithm is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/b/70b847bcc336a083710eeb0f1cd8d13466a4181c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b} = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"49\" height=\"37\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/1/991725303e6ff381cf3b0e3dd87eb686159837a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{2}{3}b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" />, which is option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c3218ca790f4eac4048f34f68433655b19e1f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME\" title=\"1970 AHSME\">1970 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1970 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1970\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1